<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίᾱτος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθωρο-ίητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incurable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.87
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκος, τραῦμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				877a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				878c
			</span></i>: also in moral sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράγματα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				660c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἀνήκεστα κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.156
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελευθερία ἀ. ἐστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1121b13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>incurable, incorrigible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				410a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Grg.</u>
				526b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κατὰ τὴν μοχθηρίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1165b18
				</span></i>
			, al. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνιάτως, ἔχειν</span> to be
				<i>incurable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				113e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.324
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀ. κακοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1137a29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μετάνοια</span>
			<i>unavailing</i> repentance, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.4.12
			</span></i>.</div>
